---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="The month-long Business Rivalries event begins! Claim a free Arcadius Business Center Office, earn 4X on Special Vehicle Work, and grab a free Penaud La Coureuse."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">September 3, 2026 — September 9, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    The month-long <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">Business Rivalries</span> event brings bonuses for Executives, Bikers, Gunrunners and Nightclub Owners over the next four weeks. This week spotlights Executives with a <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">free Arcadius Business Center Office</span>, 4X GTA$ and RP on Special Vehicle Work, 2X on Mixed Goods Exports, and doubled Special Cargo sourcing speeds.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Earn GTA$1,000,000 from selling Special Cargo to get the Yeti x LS Customs Tracksuit and a 10X Reward of GTA$1,000,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Month-Long Challenge:</strong> Complete at least one Weekly Challenge over the next three weeks to claim a free Penaud La Coureuse and complimentary HSW upgrade (claimable Sept 24–30)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Business Battles:</strong> Deliver crates to receive guaranteed clothing rewards: Six Figure Tee, Ride or Die Tee, Red and White Ammu-Nation Cap, or Bourgeoix Tee</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Property:</strong> Claim the Arcadius Business Center Executive Office for completely free this week</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">4X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Special Vehicle Work</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Mission Series</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Madrazo Hits, Export Mixed Goods Missions (via Executive Office Assistant), and Diamond Adversary Series</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X SPEED</span> <strong>Boost:</strong> Staff Sourcing Special Cargo</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FREE (100% OFF):</strong> Arcadius Business Center Executive Office</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>70% OFF:</strong> Coil Cyclone II</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Buckingham Maverick, Coil Cyclone, Declasse Yosemite 1500, Dewbauchee Specter, Dewbauchee Vagner, Grotti Cheetah, HVY Insurgent Pick-Up, Karin 190z, Lampadati Novak, Mammoth Squaddie, Ocelot Jugular, Överflöd Entity XF, Übermacht Rhinehart, Vapid Dominator GTX, Vapid Ellie, and Western Company Seabreeze</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF):</strong> Precision Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF GTA+):</strong> Stun Gun</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Railgun, Grenade Launcher, Flare Gun, Knife, Tear Gas, Molotovs & Sticky Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Declasse Impaler SZ</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Karin Woodlander (Place Top 2 in the LS Car Meet Series)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Coil Cyclone, Dewbauchee Vagner, Grotti Cheetah, Karin 190z & Överflöd Entity XF</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Benefactor LRC GT & Pfister X-treme</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Lampadati Novak, Ocelot Jugular & Vapid Dominator GTX</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Declasse Vigero ZX Convertible</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Downtown Underground</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Up Chiliad (Standard) & East Vinewood to Vespucci Beach (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Consumato, Stacks Study V, Trust</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Project Breakaway File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Pfister Astron</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Cargo Ship Robbery - Ocelot Jugular</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Gangbanger Robbery - Canis Kamacho</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>